WEBVTT

00:02:57.496 --> 00:03:00.579
activity in the ventrolateral
prefrontal cortex

00:03:00.621 --> 00:03:02.704
and the superior temporal sulcus

00:03:02.746 --> 00:03:04.913
correlates with perceptions

00:03:04.954 --> 00:03:07.829
of how frequently those behaviors
occur in daily life.

00:03:07.871 --> 00:03:10.246
In other words, the brain 
seems to be tracking

00:03:10.288 --> 00:03:13.204
low-level statistical 
properties of behavior

00:03:13.246 --> 00:03:17.829
in order to make complex decisions
regarding other people’s character.

00:03:18.079 --> 00:03:19.121
It needs to decide

00:03:19.163 --> 00:03:22.246
“Is this person’s behavior typical
or is it out of the ordinary?”

00:03:22.288 --> 00:03:23.288
In the situation

00:03:23.329 --> 00:03:25.996
with the obnoxious-football-fan-
turned-good-samaritan,

00:03:26.038 --> 00:03:27.371
your brain says,

00:03:27.413 --> 00:03:28.663
"Well, in my experience,

00:03:28.704 --> 00:03:31.371
pretty much anyone would lend
someone their umbrella,